invariant: INV-14
file: tls.c
catches: unit
reason: a config carrying both a PSK and a pin is no longer refused, it
  silently resolves to pinned mode, so a provisioning mistake picks an
  auth mode instead of failing closed

--- old
    int pin_ok = cfg->psk == NULL && cfg->server_pubkey != NULL && pin_len_ok;
--- new
    int pin_ok = cfg->server_pubkey != NULL && pin_len_ok;
